WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.370
Triton, going the wrong way round.

00:03.070 --> 00:10.239
One spacecraft has ever visited Neptune: Voyager 2, on 25 August 1989.

00:10.689 --> 00:23.634
Five hours after passing the planet it flew by Triton, forty thousand kilometres up, and found a surface at minus 235 degrees with geysers going off on it.
